7%. This represented having a lack of partners & excellent study environment were key factors affecting the ability of oral fluency in English speaking of AV113 students.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":445.05398291015626,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":70.944,"r":527.4459999999998,"t":533.3859829101564},"charspan":[0,524],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/4","text":"It is firmly noticeable that having a lack of a partner to practice speaking and having a lack of an excellent study environment were the main problems which students encountered when they studied at home, followed by 11 (36.66%) and 11 (36.66%). Besides that, the figure for having a lack of time for practicing speaking at home was just approximately 27%. This represented having a lack of partners & excellent study environment were key factors affecting the ability of oral fluency in English speaking of AV113 students."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"caption","orig":"Table 2: Students respond to how often they practice speaking skills by following methods such as reading books, watching movies, and writing paragraphs.","parent":{"$ref":"#/tables/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":407.8339829101563,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":70.944,"r":527.3239999999998,"t":433.7859829101563},"charspan":[0,153],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/5","text":"Table 2: Students respond to how often they practice speaking skills by following methods such as reading books, watching movies, and writing paragraphs."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"As the information depicted in the above table, 12 (40%) and 10 (33.33%) students always answered and never, respectively. Plus, eight students who spent lack of time for those activities was just around 26.66%. Indeed, these figures led to the imbalance between helpful activities for  English  speaking  practice,  and  it  also  wreaked  havoc  on  the  student's  oral  fluency improvement.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":114.16398291015628,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":70.944,"r":527.3519999999997,"t":186.89598291015636},"charspan":[0,394],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/6","text":"As the information depicted in the above table, 12 (40%) and 10 (33.33%) students always answered and never, respectively. Plus, eight students who spent lack of time for those activities was just around 26.66%. Indeed, these figures led to the imbalance between helpful activities for  English  speaking  practice,  and  it  also  wreaked  havoc  on  the  student's  oral  fluency improvement."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"page_footer","orig":"61","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":42.887982910156325,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":293.21,"r":304.46,"t":50.63698291015635},"charspan":[0,2],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/7","text":"61"}],"version":"1.10.0"}